{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>At the appointed season of the month of the spring.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory derived from here: Rabbi Yehudah ben Batera said — you must bring it only in the month of the spring, and if the grain has not ripened, they intercalate the year. And it says, ״ולא יראו פני ריקם״ — 'and they shall not appear before Me empty-handed' — that is to say, without an offering; and he should bring at the very least an עולה and שלמים."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:03:16.319044593Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}